    name:'Jainism',category:'Religious and philosophical tradition',shortDefinition:'A diverse South Asian tradition of Jinas, nonviolence, plural conscious selves, material karma, disciplined knowledge and conduct, and liberation without a creator god.',oneSentencePurpose:'Trains view, knowledge, and conduct so living selves can minimize injury, stop karmic bondage, and realize unobstructed freedom.',
